   "source": [
    "# For loop"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "48545b2c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Avoid invalidated iterator\n",
    "\n",
    "```cpp\n",
    "void erase_all(vector<int>& vec, int val) {\n",
    "    for (auto iter = vec.begin(); iter != vec.end();) {\n",
    "        if (*iter == val) iter = vec.erase(iter);\n",
    "        else ++iter;\n",
    "    }\n",
    "}\n",
    "```"
   ]
